{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_fartth_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_fartth_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Where She Belongs",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_fartth_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "38114b44c88b6aa9c257fa7501cbaab15af7b49f22ac8448d769602ee6035451",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "'You will come back? Really? After you become a knight?'\n'It's a promise then. We'll wait for you to come home, showered in glory, and then we'll spread the word that our town is the home of the Justyna, the knight!'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "My... home."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carefree Boy",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carefree Boy",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "I've never seen you in the village. Are you from outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I was born here. Then I went to Kawalerielki."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carefree Boy",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "Kawalerielki! Are you a knight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carefree Boy",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "You must be! Your armor looks much better than the wooden stuff Hubert makes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carefree Boy",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "Can I see your crossbow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kind Villager",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Millen! Stop bothering people!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kind Villager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "I'm sorry, the boy's been reading too many knight novels lately. The questions flow nonstop when he meets someone from out of town."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kind Villager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "Wait, is it just me... or do you look familiar...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Aunt Danka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "Justyna...? You're really back... oh, I suppose it's <i>Fartooth Knight</i> now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "We saw the news about your title. Everyone's happy for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "You remember old Cole? He saves clippings of every headline about you on his wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "He opens a bottle whenever you win a competition—probably just an excuse for him to drink more."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "You got sick... we heard about it on the news. Everyone in the village is worried."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "It's under control."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "Very good, very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "What's that in your hand, Millen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "The knight's quiver."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "Don't touch that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "Err, I mean... give it back to Fartooth Knight. It's very expensive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "It's dangerous, even if it won't hurt you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I'm sorry, I should be more considerate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aunt Danka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "Do you want to sit a spell, Fartooth Knight? We've all missed you. I'll just need to give them a heads-up... to prepare properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What are you standing there for, Fartooth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "We have to count the Infected after the evacuation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "...Group Two, all accounted for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "(When did she count them? She was definitely daydreaming.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "text": "Has anyone seen Zola? Where did she go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "Is something wrong, Mr. Farone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Farone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "text": "I think Zola went out to take a look at the new camp, but she's not back yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "Did anyone see her when we moved over from Residential Sector 9?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Farone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "text": "I wasn't paying attention... it was still dark, and I was leading the way for a villager with a bad leg..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll find her, but we need to narrow down the area. There are a lot of buildings between the two sectors."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Sona..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I may know where the girl went."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The day before..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheerful Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Hello again, friends."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "How many times has it been in the last six months?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheerful Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "This is the fourth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheerful Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "It's been a long stay in this abandoned industrial area, all things considered. Three full months since the last evacuation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheerful Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "I still remember that time the Armorless Union came knocking just a few days after we settled down. Since then, I've kept my stuff down to what I can fit in a couple of bags, ready to leave at a moment's notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "Sorry, folks. Sona's working to find a place you can stay for the long haul."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheerful Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "It's not your fault. It's all thanks to Pinus Sylvestris that we're still able to stay in Kawalerielki at all. Besides, where can a bunch of Infected go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheerful Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "We got used to it when we wandered the edge of the nomadic plate. But Zola didn't like it, and even had a fight with Mr. Farone over it in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "The General Chamber of Commerce crackdown is intensifying. Not just the commercial plates; the residential areas aren't safe anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "Armorless Union patrols have been spotted on the streets nearby. Not many, but it's a warning sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "I say we pound 'em flat and show those empty suits this is Pinus Sylvestris turf."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "And give them an excuse to blow up our factory while we're short-handed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "What do you think, Justyna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "...It's just an abandoned factory."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "That's right! We'll find another place nearby—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "...It's not home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Their home was destroyed in a Catastrophe. They should move to a safer place, so that more may live."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Fartooth!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "We don't have what it takes to butt heads with the GCC directly, not yet. Maybe someday we'll have our own plate, and every Infected in Kawalerielki will have a home to go back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "We are setting out first thing tomorrow morning. Ashley and I know the routes best, so we'll lead the pack. Iwona, you clear any obstacles. Justyna, you're on recon duty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "As for tonight—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I'll keep watch."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Is that...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "...Zola?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Those people in black weren't here in this alley a few days ago..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "No, I'll be late if I take any more detours. I'll have to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Mmph—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Don't leave the camp at night. It's dangerous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Justyna..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I'll take you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "No, no! Rita's waiting for me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Rita?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Don't tell Mr. Farone, please. He'll be mad if he finds out I'm friends with a kid from the residential district."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "But Rita's a good girl, really. She doesn't care about my sickness, she says I'm good at drawing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Why do we have to move all the time, Justyna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "I am the same as everybody else when I wrap myself up. Nobody found out I was sick when Rita took me into a shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "I don't want to move again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "After the village got destroyed, we drifted around the wilderness, slowly running out of food."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "We were only able to get into Kawalerielki because Mr. Farone found Sona."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "But we're still drifting. We just do it underground now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "I can barely remember the berries that grew on the trees of the village. I used to love them so much..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "We wouldn't be like this if the village was still around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Is there anywhere the Infected can go at all...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Was your home destroyed by Catastrophe too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "No, that village has not faced a single Catastrophe in its entire history."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Sounds nice... where is it? Is it pretty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "It sits in the north, where the forest meets the plains."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "It is... a beautiful place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "What's your hometown like, Justyna? Tell me all about it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Maybe next time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "Who's there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "A third patrol?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Voice from the Communicator",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Come in, patrol... come in... do you require backup...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "We need to move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "But I haven't said goodbye to Rita yet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Farone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "text": "I told her not to play with uninfected children!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "There are no kids Zola's age in the camp. She's lonely."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "The Armorless Union doesn't care that she's a child."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "She's Infected. To them, young doesn't mean innocent; it just means easier <i>cleanup.</i>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Farone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "Justyna. How sure are you about Zola?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "...I can't be sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "We ruffled feathers when we got out of Sector 9. The Armorless Union is probably watching the warehouse right now. Scouts, troopers... they'll be out in force."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "It's not just this district that we have to protect. There's another group of refugees who just arrived at the outskirts of Kawalerielki today, waiting for our escort."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "I thought I heard something in that storage room. Should we check it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "In an abandoned warehouse like this, there're bound to be critters crawling around. I'm not going in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "The storage room... that's where Zola was drawing her pictures!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Green... red stripes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Yes, yes... and yellow, just like her eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "There's a pattern on her quiver, and shiny bolts inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Justyna's an amazing shot... one bolt, and all the bad guys in black scatter..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "No need to be scared... no need to be scared..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "The scope's in the wrong place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I couldn't aim properly if it were so far forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Justyna!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "I... I'm so sorry... I just wanted to get the parting gift I made for Rita..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "I wanted to keep it... even if I couldn't give it to her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "You'll meet again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Let's get out of here. Can you walk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "I twisted my ankle when I came in... I'm sorry... I'm so scared..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "It's okay. No need to apologize."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Close your eyes, Zola."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Yesterday, you asked me what my hometown was like."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Close your eyes, and I'll tell you all about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Wh-What's that sound?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "A-Are you okay, Justyna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I'm fine. Keep your eyes shut."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "The bug lands on a wheat stalk. The harvest sickle swings, and it dives into the soil."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "And the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "The melody on the wind is the little tune that Uncle Cole liked to play."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "That's my... home."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "(The reinforcements came quickly. It's going to be hard to get through the front door carrying Zola...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "What was that sound?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Voice from the Communicator",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We're under attack! This is where the Infected knights have been harboring the refugees. Be on your guard!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "(Come on, Justyna... you've faced down multiple enemies in the tourneys... you can think of something...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "...Wild Mane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "So many assassins to guard one abandoned warehouse. Since when is the GCC in the business of bleeding money?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "You think you can take us all by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "Hmph, one more helper won't make a difference—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "You're rushing too far ahead, Wild Mane!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "That's what being a lancer is all about—charging into the fray and messing up enemy formations! Standard tactics."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "Then what's the point of making a plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Got to adapt to change."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "Ashley means you're too far from the formation for her to protect you with her shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "That's not what I said!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "We're here to get Justyna, aren't we? Where is she?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "There."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "You were right, Justyna. You found Zola."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Thanks... all of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "You're welcome."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "The rest of the knights are off to help our new friends. We were always going to hold back here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "I just didn't expect you to charge even faster than me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "We haven't talked much, but I think I like you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "More guys coming in, eleven o'clock and two o'clock."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "Ashley—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "They're too scattered. I don't have enough ammo left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Leave it to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "They have a sniper! Form up, don't get picked off!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "Good job."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Front door's open. All the Armorless Union assassins in the factory are down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "Communications equipment's dealt with. There won't be any more reinforcements for a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Something isn't right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Zola? You can open your eyes now. A pity you missed the fight, but you are too young for this."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wind isn't right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "Justyna? What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Armorless Union Assassin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "Argh—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Phew, that was close."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Didn't see that sniper up there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "How'd you spot him, Justyna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I couldn't hear the sound of the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Well... there's a window there. Wind affects the trajectory of a projectile."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "I'm guessing you didn't get it either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "You'll get used to the way Justyna talks soon enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Zola."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zola",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "Justyna..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "It's safe now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Let's go home."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "'Beep beep'—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "What's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Justice Knight'",
      "speakerId": "avg_4000_jnight_1",
      "text": "(Inquisitive beeping)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Wild Mane's... pet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Justice Knight'",
      "speakerId": "avg_4000_jnight_1",
      "text": "(Joyous beeping)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Justice Knight'",
      "speakerId": "avg_4000_jnight_1",
      "text": "(Cheerful beeping)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Hey, stop! You'll wake everyone up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "Where's the switch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "The switch is behind the plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "...Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "I wouldn't recommend shutting her off, though. Justice Knight gets lonely when she can't get a signal around her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "You like to be with people, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Justice Knight'",
      "speakerId": "avg_4000_jnight_1",
      "text": "(Joyous beeping)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Hey, Justyna... what's that sound? I've never heard it before..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "It's my flute."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "You play the flute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Oh... I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "You had Justice put out a call because you wanted an audience, didn't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Well, you've found one. I don't know much about music, but I'm a great listener."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Go ahead and play, Fartooth Knight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "You just wanted to get in on the action."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Greynuty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "Did Justice wake you up too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "No, YOU woke me up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "You should thank me, then. Justyna is putting on a show."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "Don't pressure her... is that a flute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "I used to live near an old woman with a bad leg. I could hear her playing in her house, one of these hand-made flutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "Now I'm starting to miss the traditional melodies from back in the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "What's that? An attic party, and I wasn't invited?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "And there I was, thinking I was giving you a bit more sleep after that rescue operation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "You got woken up too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "I was thinking about Zola."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "Iwona's right. We can't hide underground forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "People have gotten so used to the nomadic life that they're beginning to forget even the Infected deserve to have a home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "Come down and hear out my new idea, since you're up anyway."
